    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Social Media Automation — LinkedIn Post Generator\n\nA workflow that turns your Google Tasks research notes into ready-to-post LinkedIn content and logs it to a Google Sheet.\n\nFlow (step by step):\n\n    Manual trigger — you start it with \"Execute workflow\".\n    Get many tasks (Google Tasks) — pulls tasks from your task list; each task's notes field holds your research.\n    Message a model (OpenAI, GPT-5-mini) — takes that research and generates three LinkedIn post ideas, each with a topic and a reference.\n    AI Agent (OpenAI Chat Model) — reads those three ideas and writes a full LinkedIn post for each (with hashtags at the bottom).\n    Append row in sheet (Google Sheets tool) — the agent appends each result as a new row into your \"Content Ideas\" spreadsheet, across three columns: Topic, Reference, Post.\n\nResult: one click → three finished LinkedIn posts saved as rows in your Google Sheet, ready to review and publish.",
        "height": 416,
        "width": 928
      },
